00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.610
It's all thanks to our omelet rice!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:01.720
Foodstuffs save the world-nano!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.680
Thank you for waiting-kuma.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.540
It's the Ajimi vs Cosmo AutDrea Coord Showdown!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.480
The two of them have finally finished creating their best coords-kuma!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.900
Here we have the final showdown.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:20.530
Now then, let's have the famous designer Cosmos's coord-kuma.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:26.710
