Mikan wants to eat herself-nano.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.480
Oh man.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:47.930
And the final bout has ended in a draw-kuma!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.120
I see.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.690
Another tie.

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:56.530
Our match will have to be continued once again-daVinci.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:01.990
