00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.890
However, Ajimi!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:06.580
When that day comes, I shall win!

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:09.540
Ponkan won't lose either-daVinci!

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.380
