00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.630
Ajimi's ketchup-bruegel!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.390
Wow!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:29.100
Portraits of us-nano!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:31.040
Thank you.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:34.980
Thanks to this omelet rice, we remembered something we had long forgotten.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:39.770
Back when I shared that one-of-a-kind omelet rice with Ajimi,

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.500
I was also cosmically dedicated to studying design.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.200
Okay! Okay! Let's all dig in-rembrandt!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.770
Capisce!
Hooray!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:49.410
Huh?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.360
Eh?

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.870
