00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.680
Does this mean...

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:59.760
...the five of us just formed a team for the AutDrea?!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.380
Looks that way-nano.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.840
No way.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:07.430
To be able to stand on stage wearing my own coord is cosmically surprising!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:11.500
Surprising-klimt! Sparkling-picasso! DaVinci!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:12.850
Looking forward to it-crayon!
I look forward to it!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.190
Again...

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.820
Mirei... Sophie...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:22.930
Leona!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.570
Aloma!

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.850
They're falling apart.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.880
This cosmically annoying individual...

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:38.960
...goes here.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.600
Dream Team formed!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.270
We might as well go along with it!

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:23.030
Let's not lose to Phantom Thief Genius or any other team!

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:23.650
Nano!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.860
Ponkan's first Dream Team-daVinci!

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:27.120
Next time:

